{"translation":{"id":"cmn_cbs","name":"Biblica® 圣经当代译本开放资源","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmncbs","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"CBS","englishName":"Mandarin Chinese Open Contemporary Bible (Simplified)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"74bf453a33641322ae4ddd23e051ee64d1412722972e541371ef97308285fe7d","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/books.json","numberOfBooks":66,"totalNumberOfChapters":1189,"totalNumberOfVerses":30961,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"HOS","translationId":"cmn_cbs","name":"何西阿书","commonName":"何西阿书","title":"何西阿书","order":28,"numberOfChapters":14,"sha256":"0fd01139d1173aab3c4eae9aadc1f8604860ccbde5e4b3d2c68eec56323410c3","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/1.json","lastChapterNumber":14,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/14.json","totalNumberOfVerses":197},"chapter":{"number":5,"content":[{"type":"heading","content":["对以色列和犹大的审判"]},{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":[{"text":"“祭司啊，要听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列家啊，要留心听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"王室啊，要侧耳听！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"这是对你们的审判，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为你们像设在米斯巴的圈套，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"像铺在他泊山的网罗。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"你们这些叛逆之徒大肆杀戮，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要责罚你们所有人。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我对以法莲一清二楚，以色列瞒不过我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲做了妓女，以色列被玷污了。”","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":[{"text":"他们的恶行阻挠他们归向自己的上帝，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为淫乱之灵占据了他们的心，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以致他们不认识耶和华。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列被自己的傲慢指控，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以色列和以法莲要跌倒在自己的罪中，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大也要一同跌倒。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们牵着牛羊去寻求耶和华，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"却寻不到，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"因为祂已离他们而去。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们对耶和华不忠，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"所生的是私生子，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们和他们的田地必在朔日被吞噬。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":[{"text":"耶和华说：","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"“要在基比亚吹角，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在拉玛鸣号，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在伯·亚文呐喊，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"便雅悯啊，敌人就在你身后！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲啊，你要在受惩罚的日子沦为废墟！","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要在以色列各支派中宣告将来必要发生的事！","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大的首领如同擅移地界的人，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"侵吞以色列的领土，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要将烈怒如洪水般倾泻在他们身上。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲因甘愿追随偶像而受欺压，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"被审判压碎。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":12,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要使以法莲像虫蛀的衣服，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"使犹大家像朽烂的木头。","poem":1}]},{"type":"line_break"},{"type":"verse","number":13,"content":[{"text":"“以法莲见自己患病，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"犹大见自己有伤，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"以法莲便向强大的亚述王","poem":1},{"noteId":11},{"text":"求救。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"亚述王却不能医治你们，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"也无法为你们疗伤。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":14,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要像狮子一样对待以法莲，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"如猛狮一样对待犹大家，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"将他们撕碎、拖走，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"无人能营救他们。","poem":1}]},{"type":"verse","number":15,"content":[{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"我要返回我的居所，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"直到他们知罪来寻求我。","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"在苦难的日子里，","poem":1},{"lineBreak":true},{"text":"他们必恳切地寻求我。”","poem":1}]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":11,"caller":"+","text":"“强大的亚述王”或译为“耶雷布王”，同10:6。","reference":{"chapter":5,"verse":13}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/5.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/6.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_cbs/HOS/4.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":15}